#: building_visit/Building_Directly_With_CMake.rst:4
msgid "Building Directly with CMake"
msgstr "直接使用 CMake 构建"
#: building_visit/Building_Directly_With_CMake.rst:5
msgid "If a *config site file* is available for the platform you wish to build on, VisIt_ can often be built without the use of the ``build_visit`` script, with these steps."
msgstr ""
"如果你要构建的平台有可用的 *config site file*，通常可以不使用 ``build_visit`` 脚本，按以下步骤直接构建 VisIt_。"
#: building_visit/Building_Directly_With_CMake.rst:13
msgid "If ``build_visit`` was used to build VisIt_ on the platform in the past, it should have created a cmake file specific to your machine which we call a *config site* file. CMake simply needs to be told where to find it using the ``-DVISIT_CONFIG_SITE`` option. Examples of *config site* files for a variety of machines VisIt_ developers directly support can be found in the `config-site <https://github.com/visit-dav/visit/tree/develop/src/config-site>`_ directory."
msgstr ""
"如果过去在该平台上使用过 ``build_visit`` 构建 VisIt_，它应当会创建一个与你的机器对应的 cmake 文件，我们称之为 *config site* file。CMake 只需要通过 ``-DVISIT_CONFIG_SITE`` 选项知道该文件的位置即可。VisIt_ 开发者直接支持的多种机器对应的 *config site* file 示例可以在 `config-site <https://github.com/visit-dav/visit/tree/develop/src/config-site>`_ 目录中找到。"
#: building_visit/Building_Directly_With_CMake.rst:22
msgid "For cases where a *config-site* file will not be used, this must be explicitly indicated by passing ``-DVISIT_CONFIG_SITE=NONE``. This is useful in cases where ``-C CMakeCache.txt`` is used, or where all the relevant CMake variables are specified on the command-line to CMake itself instead of a *config-site* file."
msgstr ""
"如果不使用 *config-site* 文件，必须显式传入 ``-DVISIT_CONFIG_SITE=NONE`` 来指明。这在使用 ``-C CMakeCache.txt`` 的情况下，或将所有相关 CMake 变量直接在 CMake 命令行中指定（而不是通过 *config-site* 文件）时很有用。"
#: building_visit/Building_Directly_With_CMake.rst:33
msgid "CMake Variables"
msgstr "CMake 变量"
#: building_visit/Building_Directly_With_CMake.rst:35
msgid "The following CMake vars can be modified to suit your build needs."
msgstr "以下 CMake 变量可根据你的构建需求进行修改。"
#: building_visit/Building_Directly_With_CMake.rst:37
msgid "When specified via a command-line invocation of CMake, they should be specified as: VARNAME:TYPE=value, eg 'VISIT_BUILD_ALL_PLUGINS:BOOL=ON'."
msgstr ""
"通过命令行调用 CMake 指定变量时，应使用：VARNAME:TYPE=value 的形式，例如 'VISIT_BUILD_ALL_PLUGINS:BOOL=ON'。"
#: building_visit/Building_Directly_With_CMake.rst:39
msgid "The defaults listed are the settings used if the Variable has not been set in a *config-site* file."
msgstr ""
"这里列出的默认值是在 *config-site* 文件中未设置该变量时所使用的设置。"
